Subject: [PATCH] Task 15: acquisition cost accepts thousands commas

Add MoneyInput (strict parse to BigDecimal, comma formatting) and use it in
Add/Edit Property: accepts 1250000, 1,250,000, 1,250,000.50 and surrounding
spaces; rejects letters, misplaced commas, more than one decimal point, more
than 2 decimals, negatives, empty input and values too large for DECIMAL(12,2).
Edit Property now pre-fills the cost as 1,250,000.00.

